{"data":[{"author_id":"925446092669489154","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:06:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109827994738946518"],"id":"2109827994738946518","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":41,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"大多数人学缠论，第一步就走错了。\n\n他们把它当成「预测」工具，想提前算出明天是涨还是跌。\n\n错了。\n\n缠论的本质是「分类」，不是「预测」。\n\n缠中说禅最狠的一句话：走势必完美。\n\n任何一段走势，不管是盘整还是趋势，最终一定会把它的结构走完。所以你不必去猜方向，只要认出它现在走到了哪一步。","url":"https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2109827994738946518"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109794649821138944","3_2109794898446888960","3_2109795098171207680"]},"author_id":"1910907485554462720","created_at":"2026-10-12T23:56:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109795257554702701"],"id":"2109795257554702701","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2398,"like_count":14,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":2},"text":"昨天两点广场＆腾讯会议内部直播说这里有潜在30min3卖预期\n\n去5min定位2卖去做空\n时隔一天 三卖正在进行中\n\n不知道那些说缠论复盘有用，实盘没用的小伙伴有啥感想~ https://t.co/cgWVcnqaiM","url":"https://x.com/Cycle_King1913/status/2109795257554702701"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109960477623402496"]},"author_id":"1495253346311020545","created_at":"2026-10-13T11:01:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109962680643809627"],"id":"2109962680643809627","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":7478,"like_count":24,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109941403749118277","type":"quoted"}],"text":"比特币 12 小时往上的收敛结构没有完成\n\n因为没有向上闭合，这更加意味着日线级别还是一个空的状态。\n\n从缠论的结构来分析，目前高位整理的框架可以用一个中枢来解释：\n\n1. 75000 这个价位就是这个中枢的下沿；\n\n2. 87395 就是它的上沿。 https://t.co/hfNSHfmxqC https://t.co/JNqX7LGmPa","url":"https://x.com/zfcbtc/status/2109962680643809627"},{"author_id":"1685620377941364736","created_at":"2026-10-14T13:59:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110369832021664193"],"id":"2110369832021664193","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":169,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"根据《捍卫马克思》《货币战争和人民币战略》两套逻辑来讲目前中国金融市场的阵痛。\n\n很多人盯着美股新高、A 股新低，不断发问，为什么实体经济各有故事，资本市场却走出完全背离行情？\n因为资本市场是资本虚拟化的财富转移游戏，是全球化下国与国经济博弈的直接战场，绝非简单的实体经济镜像。","url":"https://x.com/zhishuzengzhang/status/2110369832021664193"},{"article":{"title":"正常人可不可以偶尔透析，可以让肾脏功能更好、排毒效果更好吗？"},"author_id":"1715475430336061440","created_at":"2026-10-13T09:38:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109941846260494792"],"id":"2109941846260494792","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":52,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"网友问：正常人可不可以偶尔透析，可以让肾脏功能更好、排毒效果更好吗？ 不可以，方向正好反了。 https://t.co/uMOeHc8gsN","url":"https://x.com/laoyue1991/status/2109941846260494792"},{"author_id":"2108505586526740480","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:13:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109875236929929365"],"id":"2109875236929929365","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":12,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"《修定与参禅证道》文章摘录\n\n第六章     禅定与见道的关系","url":"https://x.com/yongfreeg8/status/2109875236929929365"},{"article":{"title":"鲁迅：在铁屋子里呐喊的人"},"author_id":"2869390354","created_at":"2026-10-13T09:21:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109937605890740432"],"id":"2109937605890740432","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5392,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"https://t.co/5tawWubT39","url":"https://x.com/jhdxhl/status/2109937605890740432"},{"author_id":"1852592574751756288","created_at":"2026-10-13T01:28:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109818419885514920"],"id":"2109818419885514920","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"想学习缠论，有没有好点的股票缠论书籍或课程推荐的？","url":"https://x.com/will980706/status/2109818419885514920"},{"author_id":"1592938896161001472","created_at":"2026-10-14T01:00:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110173888437170474"],"id":"2110173888437170474","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":42,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"《高山说缠》-今日早课之缠论解析10.14 https://t.co/EjtERn6zh8 来自 @YouTube","url":"https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2110173888437170474"},{"author_id":"925446092669489154","created_at":"2026-10-14T18:33:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110438954453418399"],"id":"2110438954453418399","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":32,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"缠论里常说的“级别”，和软件上的“30 分钟线”“日线”，\n是一回事吗？\n\n不完全是。\n我把它拆成三层来看：\n\n▌“级别”的三层意思\n① 定义层：靠“嵌套”\n🔹 中枢，由至少 𝟯 段“次级别走势类型”重叠构成\n🔹 本级别的走势类型，又由本级别的中枢和连接段组成\n🔹","url":"https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2110438954453418399"},{"author_id":"2108505586526740480","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:36:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109880918601261343"],"id":"2109880918601261343","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":24,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"【莫轻园头】\n\n   　有一学僧向洛浦禅师告假辞行，想到其它地方去参学，洛浦禅师就问道：\n\n　　“此处四面是山，你要往何处去？”\n\n　　学僧哑口不知如何回答。\n\n　　洛浦禅师道：“如果你在十天内能够回答，那就请便！”","url":"https://x.com/yongfreeg8/status/2109880918601261343"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110398914884976641"]},"author_id":"925446092669489154","created_at":"2026-10-14T15:54:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110398924418597288"],"id":"2110398924418597288","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":44,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"缠论解大盘SPY\n\n目前4小时K线结构比较典型，已经形成了两中枢上涨的结构。\n\n小c段明显与小b段形成了典型的背驰结构，通胀造成市场偏悲观，没有突破成功被重新拉回到中枢B结构中，继续中枢震荡。\n\n两个中枢A和B之间形成了扩张结构，升级到更大级别的中枢，有比较强的支撑作用。 https://t.co/g6mNx96MeU","url":"https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2110398924418597288"},{"author_id":"1529615280171028480","created_at":"2026-10-14T09:43:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110305483399795184"],"id":"2110305483399795184","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":29,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"发太多缠论技术分析被限流了？🥲\n\n我去，什么情况😳","url":"https://x.com/ThetaRider_L/status/2110305483399795184"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110183058611789824"]},"author_id":"1910907485554462720","created_at":"2026-10-14T01:37:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110183073942016084"],"id":"2110183073942016084","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":28,"impression_count":3186,"like_count":40,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":5},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109584116433944617","type":"quoted"}],"text":"📚 花姐带路，100天搞懂缠论 · DAY 03\n\n缠论第三课，一句话就够：\n\n中间那根是主角。\n\n三根K线站一排——\n🔺 中间最高 = 顶分型\n🔻 中间最低 = 底分型\n顶不是山尖，底不是山谷，\n中间整根最高或最低，才算数。\n别再只看一个尖了，\n90% 的人分型找错，都错在「只看最高点，不看整根」。 https://t.co/5rHDlXtSpZ https://t.co/ECg1d0G7cu","url":"https://x.com/Cycle_King1913/status/2110183073942016084"},{"author_id":"925446092669489154","created_at":"2026-10-13T04:13:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109859938671509530"],"id":"2109859938671509530","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":56,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"缠论 · 画线之前先\"合并\"K线\n\n缠论画线的第一步，\n不是画线，是\"合并\"K线。\n\n不合并，分型就认不准。\n\n「后一根K线完全落在前一根的高低范围内，就叫包含」\n\n处理办法：\n向上走时，高点取更高，低点取更高；\n向下走时，高点取更低，低点取更低。\n\n示意（数字为虚构，只演示规则）：\n\nK1｜高 𝟭𝟬　低","url":"https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2109859938671509530"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109820276737548288"]},"author_id":"1592938896161001472","created_at":"2026-10-13T01:36:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109820427375935544"],"id":"2109820427375935544","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":31,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"10月操盘手训练营课程报名进行中，本期训练营重点围绕缠论基础进阶教学进行，让基础比较薄弱的同学逐步形成稳定的缠论操作体系，并有大量实战操作并行，在市场经济里，只要有好的心态与技术，就可以战胜一切。欢迎大家报名学习~\n\n#缠论交易体系教学 https://t.co/unzsQic7bY","url":"https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2109820427375935544"},{"author_id":"925446092669489154","created_at":"2026-10-14T05:04:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110235299150266605"],"id":"2110235299150266605","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":19,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"缠论里，\"盘整\"不是\"没走势\"，\n\"趋势\"也不是\"涨了很多天\"。\n它们是两种不同的\"走势类型\"，各有结构门槛。\n\n▌误区 vs 事实\n\n✘ 误区：连涨很多天，就是上涨趋势\n✔ 事实：缠论的\"趋势\"要有结构：至少 𝟮 个同向、依次抬高（或降低）、彼此不重叠的中枢\n\n✘ 误区：横着走，就是没走势\n✔ 事实：只含 𝟭","url":"https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2110235299150266605"},{"author_id":"1592938896161001472","created_at":"2026-10-13T01:10:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109813918654984528"],"id":"2109813918654984528","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":41,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"《高山说缠》-今日早课之缠论解析10.13 https://t.co/WswZJqQnqA 来自 @YouTube","url":"https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2109813918654984528"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110309171027648512"]},"author_id":"1592938896161001472","created_at":"2026-10-14T09:58:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110309193450459387"],"id":"2110309193450459387","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":28,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"加密市场多空继续厮杀\n全球市场都是萎靡不振\n今晚老美公布9月cpi数据\n感受行情起落的博弈魅力\n体验人性的贪婪与恐惧\n今晚19:00全网缠论公开课\n缠论拆解当下走势分类与买卖点\n锁定每周一三五免费公开课\n直播地址：微博关注《高山说缠论》\n点关注不迷路~ https://t.co/xcCeowU2jI","url":"https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2110309193450459387"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2109981864463302656"]},"author_id":"1709608733418930180","created_at":"2026-10-13T12:17:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109981901104861418"],"id":"2109981901104861418","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"#缠论 交易员日常。 https://t.co/O8HxCrhL4Y","url":"https://x.com/wngzhngchn69881/status/2109981901104861418"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-10-13T03:59:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109856411194917182"],"id":"2109856411194917182","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":10776,"like_count":66,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":7},"text":"很多人还没看明白，我是比缠中说缠更牛逼的存在，只是这些年不创作了而已！\n珍惜我还在发言的日子吧。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2109856411194917182"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110173207114248192"]},"author_id":"2110055477413314560","created_at":"2026-10-14T00:58:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110173355647402269"],"id":"2110173355647402269","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":22,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"缠论结构玩家 https://t.co/FCf8mVCWIb","url":"https://x.com/u32b7/status/2110173355647402269"},{"author_id":"1685620377941364736","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:01:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109826725005939128"],"id":"2109826725005939128","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":126,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2107524125090791640","type":"quoted"}],"text":"其实江卓尔的这个逻辑就是市场心理学中的博弈论\n当然也契合缠论中枢震荡之道 https://t.co/b55WGkT8Bl","url":"https://x.com/zhishuzengzhang/status/2109826725005939128"},{"author_id":"2101591217314336768","created_at":"2026-10-13T06:22:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109892498869109044"],"id":"2109892498869109044","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":10171,"like_count":71,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":1},"text":"缠论里的1买，2买，3买，哪个位置都有买点，不必纠结谁对谁错的问题！无非就是一个成本问题。\n\n课代表有以前发过的缠论买点的帖子可以贴评论区供大家学习。","url":"https://x.com/wr0789/status/2109892498869109044"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110465814050779136"]},"author_id":"1125012600960327680","created_at":"2026-10-14T20:29:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110468003930534383"],"id":"2110468003930534383","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":39,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"近十个交易日，以 $intc 为例，股价快速下破所有均线，这样的事情在 6 月至 7 月有过先例。\n有心人打开周线会发现，这不过是上次下跌的延续，符合缠论理论。\n如果没有对 7 月份以来交易的反思和记录，历史的悲剧一定会再次重演，但这次反弹账户是正收益。 https://t.co/ycNbG6xqMI","url":"https://x.com/DeepbookTrader/status/2110468003930534383"}],"includes":{"media":[{"media_key":"3_2109794649821138944","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2109794898446888960","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2109795098171207680","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2109960477623402496","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2110398914884976641","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2110183058611789824","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2109820276737548288","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2110309171027648512","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"13_2109981864463302656","type":"video"},{"media_key":"3_2110173207114248192","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2110465814050779136","type":"photo"}],"users":[{"id":"925446092669489154","name":"Peter Liu, PhD｜Wealth & Wellness","username":"InGodWeBelieveU"},{"id":"1910907485554462720","name":"花解周期（退休养老版）","username":"Cycle_King1913"},{"id":"1495253346311020545","name":"张发财 | 🅱️BTC","username":"zfcbtc"},{"id":"1685620377941364736","name":"万倍基哥","username":"zhishuzengzhang"},{"id":"1715475430336061440","name":"岳医生","username":"laoyue1991"},{"id":"2108505586526740480","name":"孟橄榄","username":"yongfreeg8"},{"id":"2869390354","name":"Fox","username":"jhdxhl"},{"id":"1852592574751756288","name":"will980706","username":"will980706"},{"id":"1592938896161001472","name":"Crypto以缠解势","username":"yycl_gaoshan"},{"id":"1529615280171028480","name":"ThetaRider｜美股·Crypto","username":"ThetaRider_L"},{"id":"1709608733418930180","name":"万事皆随我愿","username":"wngzhngchn69881"},{"id":"928496628570427392","name":"Mcfly","username":"Mcfly2140"},{"id":"2110055477413314560","name":"玉 徐","username":"u32b7"},{"id":"2101591217314336768","name":"Mistery","username":"wr0789"},{"id":"1125012600960327680","name":"Mindful Trader","username":"DeepbookTrader"}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2110468003930534383","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3juzizkz88ncx27wuskx0astytxhj7h","oldest_id":"2109795257554702701","result_count":25